# $logQuota
<div class="functionTags">
  <span id="PremiumTag">Premium</span>
</div>

Returns the remaining log entries for the `$log` function.

## Syntax
```
$logQuota
```

## Example
```
$nomention
Remaining tokens: $logQuota
```

